# Play test of Whiteout Reach (CIPlay whiteout_reach, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the camp's shelf
# (11.5 m) with the domes (the mess, the commander's), the boiler house, the snowmobile shed and the store; the Kestrel in
# the north shore's ice (her deck 5.5 m, her hold's crate 2.5 m down by her stern); the crevasse in the hill's west side
# (4 m) with the den at its end; the radio hut on the summit (21 m).
island Whiteout Reach
expect step 0
expect title Do Not Come in Winter
wait 5

# The camp: the commander's order and the locker in the mess dome
at 14 18 h=12.8
walk 14 18 to 19.5 22 to 19.5 30 to 15 32 h=11.5
zone camp
expect step 1
at 3.6 33.8 h=12.6
read Commander's order
open Mess dome locker
expect step 3

# The Kestrel in the north shore's ice: her manifest on deck
at 25 87.5 h=2.4
zone kestrel
expect step 4
at 25 92.6 h=6.8
read Ship's manifest
expect step 5

# The snowmobile shed (a step; its zone 4 m, so the walk up to the camp passes outside it), its bear, the store key;
# the store's boiler part
at 21 21 h=12.6
zone shed
expect step 6
kill Polar bear
expect step 7
walk 21 21 to 25.5 20.5 to 26.8 20.2 h=11.5 below=16
open Shed box
expect story storekey 1
wait 1
expect step 8
walk -0.25 29 to -0.25 26.2 to -1.4 24.6 h=11.7 below=14
open Camp store
expect story heatpart 1
# (no exact step here: the Kestrel's step may be counted already from the first visit)

# Back to the Kestrel (a step), down by her stern: her hold's crate
at 25 87.5 h=2.4
zone kestrel
expect step 11
at 29 100.3 h=-1.4
open Kestrel's hold crate
expect story heatpart 2
expect step 12

# The crevasse: the matriarch, the survey pack in her den
walk -46 5 to -40 5 to -36 5 h=4
zone icecaves
expect step 13
kill Polar bear
expect step 14
walk -36 5 to -24 5 to -16 5.4 h=4
open Survey pack
expect story heatpart 3
expect step 15

# The boiler: the radio's crystal; the two goats; up to the radio hut on the summit
at 14 23 h=12.6
use boiler
expect message burner catches
expect story heatpart 0
expect story radiocrystal 1
expect step 16
catch Goat 2
expect step 17
walk 14 22 to 8 10 to 3.5 5 h=21
walk 3.5 5 to 3.5 1 to 2.5 -2 h=21 below=23.5
zone radiohut
expect step 18
read Last transmission
expect step 19
use hutradio
expect message crystal clicks home

# The commander's chest in his dome, warm now
at 24 36.4 h=12.6
open Commander's chest
expect item Battery_Advanced 2
expect done
